# The lint tools the pipeline pins, for Python 3.12 and later: the top-level input of ci/requirements-lint.txt.
# Python 3.12 is the floor because flake8 reports E999 on tests/floor_seed/ below it. ci/lock.sh compiles this
# file with ci/requirements-test.in as constraints, so a package that both sets use gets the same version.
# After a change here, run: sh ci/lock.sh (network), then copy the new lock files into ci/ as it prints.
